h-pitched Female Vocal (高音女声)\n\nHusky Female Vocal (略带沙哑的女声)\n\nMature Female Vocal (成熟女声)\n\n电商适用： Enthusiastic Female Vocal (热情的女声，适合直播间助手)\n\n3. 特殊声线 (Special Vocals)\n针对你想要做的“电商叫卖”风格，可以尝试更具体的描述：\n\nRap/Chant： Fast-paced Rap (快节奏说唱)\n\n多人效果： Duo (男女双人), Group vocals (多人合唱/起哄感)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "男女声音和配置 更具自己需要的风格  组合 添加到  音乐风格", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [519.7086791992188, 326.83135986328125], "pos": [2205.6884765625, 829.7412109375], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["歌曲风格等\n放克 / Funk\n流行 / Pop\n节奏布鲁斯 / R&B\n摇滚 / Rock\n爵士 / Jazz\n说唱 / Rap\n布鲁斯 / Blues\n嘻哈 / Hip Hop\n古典 / Classical\n电子 / Electronic\n民谣 / Folk\n电子舞曲 / EDM\n乡村 / Country"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "音乐风格的填写", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 201.61219787597656], "pos": [2214.766357421875, 1248.6580810546875], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [8], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [453.9386291503906, 200], "pos": [2762.64111328125, 1357.9063720703125], "widgets_values": ["Traditional Chinese Folk, Sanxian, Woodblock, Male and Female Duet, Call and Response, Upbeat, Rhythmic, Energetic, Street Vendor Style, 140 BPM"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 10, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "音乐风格(写英文)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#353", "groupcolor": "#8A8", "color": "#232"}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [7], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "loc